window.products.push({"id":442083,"name":"GAN XIN1.5'' High 6 Digits LED Interval Timer, with Countdown/up Clock, 12/24-Hr Real Time Clock, Stopwatch by Remote Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41S2zVdKqsL._AC_.jpg","description":"What’s the Specification Details? Clock dimension: 11.4''L x4''H x 1.6''W (29cm L x 10cm H x 4cm W)  Housing material: aluminum alloy  Digits height & color: 1.5-inch (3.81cm), 2 green + 4 red digits  Light source: LED (high brightness, long life-span)  Input power: 5V DC, 2A (110-260VAC power supply)  Brightness adjustable, Buzzer alternative setting. What’s the Main Functions? 12/24H Real-time clock: 24-hour [H1 HH:MM], 12-hour [H2 HH:MM] (HH=hours, MM= minutes), press button [MODE] to convert Countdown & Count-up : format [dn MM:SS], from [dn 99:59] to [dn 00:00], [UP MM:SS], from [UP 00:00] to [UP 99:59], with buzzer alarm setting and brightness adjustable functions. Stopwatch: format [MM SS:MS], from [00 00:00] to [99 59:99] (MS = 1/100 second value) Personal-setting Alternate Timing Clock Modes as you like: Specially designed for personal-setting modes, maximum up to 99 different groups of alternate interval modes (training time, rest time & cycle times), it will run & cycle from the first group to the last one automatically as your pre-settings. You can set it to be your personal modes if you like, with buzzer alarm setting and brightness adjustable functions. What’s Included in the Package? <1> LED clock: 1 PC <2> US-standard adapter: 1 PC <3> IR remote controller: 1 PC <4> Wall bracket & screws: 1 SET <5> Instruction manual: 1 PC Important Cautions: The controller does NOT have CR2025, 3V battery, because battery is NOT accepted by Air courier, thanks for your kind understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41S2zVdKqsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAN XIN","source_asin":"B01MXESQDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MXESQDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MXESQDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":442084,"name":"Wooden Christmas Advent Calendar Book with 24 Drawers for Kids,Countdown to Christmas,LED Christmas Decoration (Wood)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719dvfdNQIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas Advent Calendar , Wooden, Hand painting, Original Designing. This advent calencar is designed with 24 drawers, which stands for 24 days prior to Christmas Day. Each drawer can be filled with Chocolate, or other small gift. From December 1st on, everyday children's can take out a gift , from the first drawers till open the 24th drawer. Wow, Christmas train is Coming! The memory of countdown of Christmas during childhood, will be a tradition that a person treasures for a life. The wooden advent calendar can be used year after year creating a tradition your family will always treasure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719dvfdNQIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XINSO","source_asin":"B09BZ6GZTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BZ6GZTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BZ6GZTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
