window.products.push({"id":442207,"name":"InteHome Robot Vacuum Cleaner, 2000Pa Suction, Quiet, Slim, Self-Charging, 120min Runtime, APP & Remote Control Automatic Smart Robotic Vacuums for Pe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CLSeAZSdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Strong Suction and Quiet Running: Robot vacuum cleaner has 2000Pa strong suction. Don't worry about pet hair, debris, crumbs and sand. Carpet automatic suction enhancement technology can clean the carpet more cleanly. The vacuum robot runs very quietly on hard floors and tiles, without affecting watching TV or practicing yoga at home. Slim Design and Large Capacity Battery: The robot vacuum is only 2.71 inches thick and 12.2 inches diameter. So it's easy to clean under sofas, chairs, beds and other furniture. 2600mA battery is sufficient to clean your large house. When the battery is low, the vacuum cleaner robot automatically goes back to recharge on charging dock . App and Voice Control: Robotic vacuum cleaner can be easily set up cleaning schedules, change the clean modes, select suction modes and control the cleaning direction by the app (2.4Ghz Wi-Fi connection). Automatic vacuum cleaner robot can start or stop cleaning through Alexa and Google Assistant. Simple and convenient operation allows you to spend more time with your family and children. Tangle-free Hair and Mop: No rolling brush design can solve the problem of hair winding. The robot vacuum mop can remove slight dirt and dust. It can sweep the floor while mopping, making cleaning so simple. Anti-dropping Technology: Anti-dropping sensors prevent the robot vacuums from falling off the stairs. Carpet boost technology climb up to 15°, allowing it to shuttle freely between hardwood and short carpet. Warranty and Quality Tested:CE, FCC, RED and RoHs certified. 12 months warranty period. Please install the app after reading the instructions. If you have any questions, please contact us first. We will solve your problem immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CLSeAZSdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InteHome","source_asin":"B09V2H9GBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V2H9GBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V2H9GBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
