window.products.push({"id":442374,"name":"2-In-1 Salt and Pepper Grinder - Dual Adjustable Coarseness Ceramic Mechanism - Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Shaker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718Dt9wLNUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fabulous Belmint dual spice mill combines into ‘one container’ design for keeping your spices in one spot Enjoy Grinding to Perfection Both Peppercorns and Sea Salt This salt and pepper grinder is another Belmint’s tradition for maintaining a simple and dynamic lifestyle. In the kitchen, having the proper tools for your recipe are essential to achieve a tasty meal that family or guests can enjoy, but somehow you have to deal with plenty of seasoning tools and containers to pour and mix the ingredients for the food that you’re cooking. It’s for this purpose, we developed this perfect spice mill concept that offers two convenient storage of spices and herbS in one container to grind the magic that makes your dishes so appetizing that everyone in the family has known for. Equip yourself with the best 2-in-1 salt and pepper grinder with adjustable ceramic rotor that grinds your spices to perfection. Elegant and Superior Design Our dual salt and pepper mill set is crafted with the highest quality stainless steel. The cylinder-shaped design is ergonomic and allows you to switch in position the spice or herb that you need for your culinary project. This dual action grinders for salt and pepper looks elegant on your countertop or dining room table, and it reduces the amount of seasoning tools for a simple and minimalist place in the kitchen. Perfect for Gifting Whether giving from mom to daughter or vice versa, this dual grinder makes great gifts for any holiday. But once you use it, it’ll be hard to give away. Make sure to order two of this special grinder. Grinding Salt and Pepper: To grind pepper, the P must be at the bottom To grind pepper, the P must be at the bottom To grind salt, the S must be at the bottom To grind salt, the S must be at the bottom Click the add to cart button and experience a unique way for grinding coarse to fine salt and herbs by ordering today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718Dt9wLNUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"blümwares","source_asin":"B01CSXNLA2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CSXNLA2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CSXNLA2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
