window.products.push({"id":442413,"name":"Manna Ring Growler | 64oz Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel | Craft and IPA Beer Growler | Keeps Beverages Fresh and Cold up to 24 Hours | Lead and BPA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hej3JYvmL._AC_SL1499_.jpg","description":"INSULATED: The Manna Ring Growler is made with double layer insulated vacuum walls for maximum temperature retention. This will keep your beer icy cold and freshly carbonated for up to 24 hours or hot beverage for piping hot for up to 12 hours. DURABLE: Made with Stainless Steel, your Growler will last you a lifetime. The matte non slip finish will ensure the grip you need to hang on to it safely while enjoying yourself to the max. LEAK & SWEAT PROOF: The Manna Ring Growler is designed with Sweat & Leak Proof technology avoiding any unpleasant spills or condensation leaks. No more wrapping your cold beers in towels when packing your bags when going out to the beach, party, park, boat party, or anywhere where your beer drinking soul desires KEEPS HOT BEVERAGES TOO: The Ring Growler will not only keep your drinks cold but also you hot coffee or tea fresh off the fire for up to 12 hours later! SAFE: Being BPA and Lead free, this bottle is eco friendly and safe to use. Toxic chemicals should be the least of your worries when simply enjoying your cold or hot beverages amongst your friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hej3JYvmL._AC_SL1499_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manna","source_asin":"B073XPTG3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073XPTG3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073XPTG3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":442414,"name":"AHNR Pull Out Cabinet Organizer, Heavy Duty Cabinet Pull Out Shelves, Slide Out Cabinet Organizer Storage for Home, Pull Out Drawers for Kitchen Cabin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kxoBzp+DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💒【SPACE-SAVING PULL-OUT CABINET】Instead of tossing all your household items in a pile under the cabinets, tidy them up with the Professional pull out cabinet organizer. This utilitarian pull out cabinet organizer offers plenty of space for your kitchen supplies, cleaning supplies and toiletries. It's a basic organizer that makes a good impact on your living space and lifestyle. 💒【LONG & SMOOTH SLIDE-OUT DRAWER】The great advantage of the three-section slides is that they extend fully, giving you full access to everything in the drawer. It allows you to not have to bend down to the cabinet to find things. Also, we have a unique ball bearing slide design. Ball bearing slides tend to support heavier items and allow for smoother rolling of the shelves that the cabinets pull out. It is a good improvement for the limited space. 💒【DIMENSIONS & EASY TO INSTALL】Measuring 11*21 inches, this pull out cabinet organizer is both small enough to fit in almost any cabinet, but it’s large enough to easily store kitchen mixers, kettles and other items. In addition, you just need a screwdriver to complete the installation. If you do not want to spend a lot of time and effort assembling, you can choose this pull out cabinet organizer! 💒【DURABLE & STURDY MATERIAL】Our cabinet pull out shelves are made of extremely hard chrome-plated metal, which are durable, rust-resistant and highly wear-resistant due to their unique composition. After several weight-bearing experiments, cabinet pull out shelves can ensure that they can still be smooth and silent when pulled out. So you don't have to worry about their load-bearing capacities! And their smooth, even glossy appearance can be well adapted to various styles of places. 💒【REMINDER OF USE】Before buying this slide out cabinet organizer, please measure the size of your cabinet carefully, especially the width and depth. The minimum cabinet size should be: 12” W*21” D. Make sure the size of the cabinet is larger than the size of the slide out cabinet organizer in order to put the slide out cabinet organizer into your cabinet intact. Only then can you experience the convenience that this slide out cabinet organizer can bring you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kxoBzp+DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AHNR","source_asin":"B0C6GP7RC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6GP7RC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6GP7RC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":442415,"name":"Oamaca 40oz Stainless Steel Water Bottle,Vacuum Insulated with Straw Lid & Spout Lid, Double Wall Insulation Leak-proof Thermos Mug,Sports Flask for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619DO6JCkRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HIGH-QUALITY STAINLESS STEEL】: Our water bottles are made of food-grade 18 / 8 stainless steel. The internal electric polishing is rust proof and durable. They are BPA Free, metal free and harmless to human health. The outer part of the thermos body is sprayed with powder, which is beautiful and fashionable. It is also suitable for mounting on the car cup holder! 【2 DIFFERENT LIDS AVAILABLE】: The sports bottle comes with 2 different types of lids to meet all your daily needs.A spout lid with a screw cap makes it easy to pick up and drink, so you can take it anywhere, anytime.Another straw lid allows you to sip easily, with a continuous seal that keeps it colder for longer. Perfect for cold drinks! 【DOUBLE-WALL VACUUM INSULATION】: We adopt double-layer insulation wall design and vacuum sealing. This means you can enjoy your favorite hot and cold drinks for a long time, no matter what season you're in. It can keep hot drinks hot for 12 hours and cold drinks cold for 24 hours! 【INSULATED & SWEAT-FREE】:The stainless steel thermos water bottle has a permanent coating on the outside, which is durable and easy to master. The anti sweat design keeps your fingers dry, preventing perspiration and condensation. Ensure no stains or burns (support hand washing or dishwasher cleaning). 【APPLICABLE TO VARIOUS OCCASIONS】: Oamaca insulated water bottle has a variety of gorgeous gradient colors, which can keep you in a good mood when drinking water. You can put this portable water bottle in your bag and take it out for camping, cycling, office and any other indoor/outdoor activities. It will also be a perfect gift for family, friends and colleagues!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619DO6JCkRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oamaca","source_asin":"B0B5WXL7HJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5WXL7HJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5WXL7HJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
