window.products.push({"id":442435,"name":"Christmas Bedding Duvet Covers Set, Christmas Santa Claus Design(New Year Present), (Queen, Duvet Cover 90\"x90\", Christmas - Santa Claus)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x-lk8fgiL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"The weather is getting colder and colder, but we are getting more excited because the much-anticipated Christmas is coming! My dad, mom and I are busy decorating the house and preparing presents for our friends. We all hope that the new year will bring more good things, and I think it will! At this time, I am waiting for the arrival of that moment, Santa Claus will put presents in my socks! That’s incredible! I put on new duvet cover and pillowcases, they are all designed for Christmas. Mom said that Santa can see our love for him when he comes to my bedroom on Christmas Day! This quilt cover set is brought home by my mom. It is very cute, has a cartoon pattern that I like, and it is soft and comfortable to sleep. Mom said that it’s made of Microfiber and it can be washed directly with a washing machine, saving her a lot of strength. I feel so happy because my mother and l both love it a lot! No more time to say that with you, I have to decorate the house now. My Christmas! It's coming!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x-lk8fgiL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMNJF","source_asin":"B07XRL1FZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XRL1FZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XRL1FZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":442436,"name":"Superior Combed Cotton, 300 Thread Count 5-Piece Bed Sheet Set, Single Ply Cotton, Deep Pocket Fitted Sheets, Soft and Luxurious Bedding Sets - Split ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":71.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8170T+a1SFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"***Impressions is now Superior brand***  Affordable Luxury Linens Experience the best in affordable luxury with these 100% Premium Long-Staple Combed Cotton sheet sets. These sheets are soft, comfortable, perfect for everyday use and sure to bring a little bit of Paradise to your home. These single ply sheets have a lustrous sateen weave and fully elasticized fitted sheets with deep pockets. The indulgently soft 300 thread count 100% Long-Staple Combed Cotton provides simple luxury and lasting durability at an affordable price.  This gorgeous sheet set can be machine washed and tumble dried low for a thorough and easy cleaning. Available in multiple sizes and colors, letting you choose the one that best suits your bedroom. It is an ideal accompaniment for modern and contemporary home décors. Coordinating Duvet Covers, Extra Pillowcase Sets, and Bed Skirts are available separately. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, to towels and bath robes, to comforters and mattress toppers, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products. See what our customers have to say: \"These are the best sheets I have ever had\" \"I love these sheets so much, I hate getting out of bed\" \"I have nothing but good things to say about this affordable set... they are cool and comfortable, couldn't be happier!\" \"I have used these sheets for over a year now and they are still like new\" \"These sheets are wonderful! Both quality and color were everything I was looking for. I've washed them a multitude of times and they look and feel as great as the first time I put them on the bed. Loved them so much just ordered a few more sets :) \" \"I will definitely purchase these in more colors. I highly recommend these sheets.\" And try them for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8170T+a1SFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B0C2YPPHWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2YPPHWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2YPPHWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
