window.products.push({"id":442681,"name":"Confetti Candy Sprinkles Dessert Party Pack - Paper Plates, Napkins, Cups, Forks, and Plastic Table Cover Set (Serves 16)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YltXuqv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add this Confetti Sprinkles Dessert Party Pack to your celebration for a fun table display! Colorful candy sprinkled plates, napkins, cups, table cover and forks can be used for birthdays at any age, baby showers, or any occasion for dessert. Neutral design is great for both boys and girls - everyone loves sprinkles! Set includes 16 paper dessert plates (7in), 16 beverage napkins (5in), 16 cups (9oz), 16 plastic forks, and 1 plastic table cover (54in x 102in).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YltXuqv-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOME & HOOPLA","source_asin":"B09C7SM7J6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C7SM7J6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C7SM7J6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":442682,"name":"The Original Reese's-Cup Mug, Chocolate, 10oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yhe40NexL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chocolate? Peanut Butter? Reese's fans know that the best taste is both at once! Celebrate that timeless taste with the Fitz and Floyd Reese's Two Great Tastes Collection. This mug is for Reese's lovers! There's no mistaking distinctive orange or fun ridged cup shape for anything but a Reese's. Enjoy your favorite hot beverage, give it as a gift or keep as part of a collection! This mug holds 10oz, is 3\" in diameter and 4\" tall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yhe40NexL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fitz & Floyd","source_asin":"B01AZ9RDUU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AZ9RDUU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AZ9RDUU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":442683,"name":"Cosi Home Heated Blanket - Electric Blanket Throw 60\" x 50\" with Soft Fleece Sherpa, 6 Heat Settings, Overheat Protection, Machine Wash – Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LpVIbn7rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COST-EFFICIENT 6 HEAT SETTINGS WITH REMOTE – The Sherpa blanket heats up fast to ensure you never wait longer than 60 seconds to reach your desired temperature up to 131°F. At a running cost of just $0.02 per hour, this Heated Throw is an economical, ecological solution to rising energy prices. 6 adjustable heat settings provide complete temperature control for unrivalled comfort, whatever the weather. EXTRA LARGE & WARM - With a size large enough for 2 adults, this 50\" x 60\" heated throw blanket allows you to wrap yourselves up and stay warm, and is even large enough to cover your feet. Integrated heating elements woven into the soft-touch fabric deliver consistent and efficient warmth, perfect for relaxing. LUXURY MICRO FLEECE & SHERPA - Made with a warm and fluffy micro-fleece fabric on one side and a cosy Sherpa to the other, these double-sided and heated blankets are perfect for keeping you cozy on the couch or in bed, on both cold winter nights and wholesome days spent indoors. MACHINE-WASHABLE & DURABLE - Our fleece blanket is 100% machine washable for your convenience. The remote control and cable are fully detachable, allowing this versatile electric heating blanket to be washed over and over again, ensuring the fabric remains clean and fresh for longer. ADVANCED SAFETY FEATURES - Unlike other throw blankets, our luxury blanket features advanced overheat protection for peace of mind. A 3-hour programmable timer, with an automatic shut-off feature, allows the throw to turn off after the desired period. Perfect for falling asleep and peace of mind if you forget to unplug.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LpVIbn7rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cosi Home","source_asin":"B09TRBBJT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TRBBJT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TRBBJT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":442684,"name":"Chantal 1.8 quart Oolong Enamel on Steel Whistling Tea Kettle, Apple Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cAgdj8nKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Oolong kettle from Chantal has an ergonomic stay-cool handle that fits comfortably in the hand for easy pouring while the wide flat bottom facilitates rapid boiling. Our easy-clean, high quality enamel, is guaranteed not to fade. Enamel-on-Steel teakettles are made with magnetic carbon steel which means they will work on all cooktops INCLUDING magnetic induction. Enamel is also easy to clean and the color will not fade over time. 1.8 qt. [7 cup] functional capacity. Limited warranty. Founded in 1971, Chantal Corporation is proud to be approaching 50 years of strength, determination and success. CEO and Founder, German-born Heida Thurlow, relocated to the United States in 1970 and soon began her entrepreneurial journey. Trained as an engineer, Ms. Thurlow has the distinction of being the first woman in the U.S. to launch and run a cookware company. She has received numerous design and utility patents for teakettle and cookware design and innovation. Chantal was the first to bring dramatic color, tempered glass lids and stay-cool handles to the kitchenware marketplace and continues to dedicate iteslf to the creation of innovative products that bring elegance to the home. Chantal products feature the healthiest cooking surfaces available today and we pledge to continually look for new innovations and manufacturing techniques which will be ideal for health conscious chefs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cAgdj8nKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chantal","source_asin":"B0888KNQST","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0888KNQST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0888KNQST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
