window.products.push({"id":442726,"name":"36pcs Christmas Snowflake Ornaments Plastic Glitter Snowflakes Ornaments for Xmas Tree Decorations, 4-inch, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vUej8MQYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄2022 Glitter Snowflake Ornaments: This is a glittering Christmas snowflake ornaments, which is made of high-quality plastic and durable. Shatterproof ornaments can complete the flash party without worrying about the danger of debris to children and pets. ❄Unique Design: The size of snowflake ornaments is 4inch/10cm. This size and weight design can just decorate your Christmas tree, filling the gaps without lowering the branches, adding sparkle to your Christmas party. ❄Package Contents: A set of 36 pieces of snowflakes in 2 different styles. There are 10 colors for you to choose, which basically meets your requirements for decoration of each scene, and complements your existing Christmas ornaments. ❄Easy to Decorate: Each piece of glitter snowflake comes with a rope, you can easily hang it on the xmas tree, or wherever you like, to add a little bling and shine. ❄Holiday Atmosphere Creator: Hanging snowflakes is very suitable for decorating your holidays, parties, weddings. Sparkling ornaments add beauty and are ideal decorations for any Christmas occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vUej8MQYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Krisdecor","source_asin":"B0B3MP82QW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442726","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3MP82QW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3MP82QW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":442727,"name":"INKWASH Waterfall Painting, Feng Shui Fountain Water Asian Wall Art Prints Decor Large Scroll Chinese Feng Shui Landscape Paintings for Christmas Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OkZ1HuOkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Beautiful Find The painting,treated by the advanced simulation technology on the Chinese paintings,has perfectly being restored back to its original style and spirit.It also has the highest artistic quality after the traditional hand-making mounting. ABOUT CHINESE LANDSCAPE FENG SHUI PAINTING The Chinese have long conceived of a magical link between mankind and the landscape - that mankind is an integral part of the universe,is swept along and controlled by its flow,and shares its fate.Feng Shui springs from these ideas and seeks to enhance and harmonise with the environment rather than deplete and dominate it. People are affected for good or ill by their surroundings grew the goal of Feng Shui - complete harmony with the natural order, which brings prosperity,health and happiness.Chinese Paintings,especially landscapes,are a conscious attempt to bring out this harmony - Chinese landscape paintings often depict a building or two,sited so as to balance with their surroundings and show mankind's ideal balanced relationship with the environment. ABOUT OUR GALLERY You are welcome to our gallery at any time.INK WASH124 S.Atlantic Blvd Monterey ParkCalifornia","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OkZ1HuOkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INKWASH","source_asin":"B01C8HHENI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442727","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C8HHENI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C8HHENI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":442728,"name":"Wreath Hangers - Brass Scroll Wreath Holder - Solid Brass Wreath Hanger from The Kensington Row Collection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D6xWT8SQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our decorative wreath holder is as sturdy as it is beautiful. Crafted of solid brass, the ornate openwork leaf-and-scroll design rivals that of the finest decorative ironwork. Measures approximately 15\"L - fits over a 2\" thick door. PLEASE NOTE: Because of the way this wreath holder is designed - you must have a clearance of at least 3/16\" between the top of your door and the door frame in order for this wreath holder to fit properly and the door to be able to close.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D6xWT8SQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KensingtonRow Home Collection","source_asin":"B00CC5DTY0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CC5DTY0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CC5DTY0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
