window.products.push({"id":442860,"name":"OMAIGA Cordless Iron, 1500W Cordless Irons for Clothes, Steam Iron with 11.84ozs Water Tank, Anti Drip Clothes Iron Steam with Ceramic Soleplate, Iron","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X7SEu9DhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPGRADE DESIGN-OMAIGA 1500W Cordless clothes steam iron provides up to 60 seconds of continuous heat and steam in cordless mode and quickly reheats in just 25 seconds when placed back on its base. The professional steam iron you can use it more easily and quickly without the limitations of twisted wires, knotted wires, or getting stuck on the ironing board. Powerful burst of steam delivers an extra blast of steam, allowing you to removing wrinkles quickly and easily. SELF-CLEANING & ANTI-CALC-Cordless steam iron have self-cleaning function, remove deposits to maintain performance and increase the iron's lifespan. Only need to presse the self-clean button, you can try the burst-of-steam feature to clean vents. When the temperature of your steam iron is insufficient to create steam, the supply of water is cut off automatically to avoid any drips from the soleplate. RAPID AND EFFICIENT-Ceramic Soleplate of this steam iron equips advanced technology which can provide even and steam to quickly remove wrinkles of clothes, and the vertical steam function of iron cordless is not only suitable for horizontal ironing, also for ironing the hanging clothes vertically. Soleplate of our cordless iron is designed with a tapered tip for multi directional ironing, use on shirt collars or in the thin spaces between buttons with pinpoint precision. NOT A USED IRON-Every steam iron needs to pass a functional TEST before going to the market, to prevent product quality problems from causing trouble to customers. So it is NORMAL when you see some WATER left in its tank. If you have any questions about this iron, please feel free to contact us, a one-year warranty is guaranteed. WIDE APPLICATION-Steam iron is equipped with 3 temperature settings, allowing for use on a variety of fabrics including Nylon,Wool,linen, cotton, silk, wool, synthetic and so on. The advanced cordless iron provides the optimal temperature for every type of clothing, unlike other one-temperature irons.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X7SEu9DhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OMAIGA","source_asin":"B0B9ZXRZBD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-442860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9ZXRZBD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9ZXRZBD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
